    "enUS": {
      "description": "Oh, I think I might have dropped too much acid onto the shield. Let me just rub a little...\n\nHm, kind of hard to read, but it looks like the name Mosarn. Never heard of him. Maybe Krog knows. Krog knows many people.",
      "summary": "Talk with Krog in Brackenwall Village.",
      "title": "The Black Shield",
